  5. Upon the availability of the information, CED can consecutively request for revision or addition of Risk Indicators at each year end for the purpose of enhancing the effectiveness of this Risk Management System. In the cases of revision or addition, CED shall request to have data and this new evaluation result fed into the Risk Management System;
